            <ArticleTitle>Severe incisional pain and long thoracic nerve injury after port-access minimally invasive mitral valve surgery.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>288-90</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The authors describe the occurrence of severe postoperative pain and long thoracic nerve injury after Port-Access minimally invasive mitral valve surgery. The potential for these events and the impact on postoperative hospitalization and rehabilitation are emphasized.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
